<title>USA: NYC MAC variable-rate notes priced at 4.25 pct.</title>
<headline>NYC MAC variable-rate notes priced at 4.25 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc. said Monday it priced Municipal Assistance Corp. for the City of New York's variable-rate note deal at a 4.25 percent rate.</p>
<p>The rate applies to $132.8 million and $132.6 million pieces of the $398 million deal. A $132.6 million commercial paper portion has not yet been priced, Smith Barney said.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
